  "snp5.12:1.3": "oghātigaṃ puṭṭhuṃ akāmam āgamaṃ: ",
  "snp5.12:1.4": "santipadaṃ brūhi sahājanetta, ",
  "snp5.12:1.5": "yathātacchaṃ Bhagavā brūhi me taṃ. 1097. ",
  "snp5.12:2.1": "Bhagavā hi kāme abhibhuyya iriyati ",
  "snp5.12:2.2": "ādicco va paṭhaviṃ teji tejasā: ",
  "snp5.12:2.3": "parittapaññassa me bhūripañña ",
  "snp5.12:2.4": "ācikkha dhammaṃ, yam ahaṃ vijaññaṃ ",
  "snp5.12:2.5": "jātijarāya idha vippahānaṃ\". 1098. ",
  "snp5.12:3.1": "\"Kāmesu vinaya gedhaṃ ",
  "snp5.12:3.2": "Jatukaṇṇī ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp5.12:3.3": "nekkhammaṃ daṭṭhu khemato, ",
  "snp5.12:3.4": "uggahītaṃ nirattaṃ vā ",
  "snp5.12:3.5": "mā te vijjittha kiñcanaṃ. 1099. ",
  "snp5.12:4.1": "Yaṃ pubbe taṃ visosehi, ",
  "snp5.12:4.2": "pacchā te māhu kiñcanaṃ, ",
  "snp5.12:4.3": "majjhe ce no gahessasi, ",
  "snp5.12:4.4": "upasanto carissasi. 1100. ",
  "snp5.12:5.1": "Sabbaso nāmarūpasmiṃ ",
  "snp5.12:5.2": "vītagedhassa brāhmaṇa ",
  "snp5.12:5.3": "āsavāssa na vijjanti, ",
  "snp5.12:5.4": "yehi maccuvasaṃ vaje\" ti JATUKAṆṆIMĀṆAVAPUCCHĀ NIṬṬHITĀ. 1101. \"Okaṃjahaṃ ",
